etaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0650b01","n":"0650b","t":"具足值佛出世演說正法親近"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0650c01","n":"0650c","t":"何得稱為非明為緣非違有支"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0651a01","n":"0651a","t":"斷說名隨眠亦名麁重若彼乃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0651b01","n":"0651b","t":"諸異熟果及異熟果增上所引"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0651c01","n":"0651c","t":"疎二所緣雜彼煩惱者謂俱生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0652a01","n":"0652a","t":"三受俱中識等六支既是種子"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0652b01","n":"0652b","t":"四靜慮廣果天下乃四無色唯"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0652c01","n":"0652c","t":"變易者不能無漏資身久住勢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0653a01","n":"0653a","t":"二位悟入所執忍第一法悟入"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0653b01","n":"0653b","t":"度時似有所緣六處顯現無性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0653c01","n":"0653c","t":"諸所生處攝受自體無性解云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0654a01","n":"0654a","t":"會同釋頌異故中邊論說八喻"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0654b01","n":"0654b","t":"虛妄無漏有為非虛妄故何故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0654c01","n":"0654c","t":"表色如應當知下自廣說同下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0655a01","n":"0655a","t":"二說或有或無其三心見道二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0655b01","n":"0655b","t":"四不壞信唯別取無漏瑜伽等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0655c01","n":"0655c","t":"別即對法第十三聲聞菩薩現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0656a01","n":"0656a","t":"勝解行位於久所作所思所說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0656b01","n":"0656b","t":"簡見道一切內起簡修道外緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0656c01","n":"0656c","t":"故留也又二乘但種助不由願"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0657a01","n":"0657a","t":"二解和會應知四智如佛地各"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1831_p0657b01","n":"0657b","t":"摩訶般若解脫法